                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Humorous 3D fighting game in which you play as Brazilian politicians in a satirical tournament of duels\n\n✅Humorous concept featuring fights between political candidates\n✅Option to watch matches controlled by the computer\n✅Good visual presentation\n✅Includes a multiplayer mode\n✅Pleasant sound effects, music, and character voice-overs\n✅Good price\n\n❌Limited number of arenas and stages\n❌Special attacks do not always deal actual damage\n❌Possibility to use repetitive attacks to lock an opponent into an infinite combo\n\n✅✅ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [strike] Bad [/strike], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [b] Decent [/b], [strike] Good [/strike], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for short games, retro indie simulators, and similar titles)\n\n[quote] If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand in my group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
